cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its measurements, cite it as below."
title: "Hive"
abstract: >-
  A local-first stack for memory, verification, and routing in language
  models. It contains Splinter Memory, the Hive Cascade, and HiveBench, the
  evaluation suite that measures both: deterministic verification, replayable
  paired A/B batteries, and the full results log.
